A styled pull-quote box with large decorative quotation marks in the wiki's accent color, an optional portrait image, and a flexible attribution line. Used for quoting utaite in interviews, streams, and social posts. See {{T|StructuredQuote}} for the earlier version.

The attribution line is assembled from up to four parts, in order: <code>speaker</code>, then ", to ''receiver''", then ", ''attribution''", then ", ''source''". The whole line is omitted if none are supplied — and note that <code>receiver</code>, <code>attribution</code> and <code>source</code> only render when <code>speaker</code> is also set.

==Syntax==
{{T|StructuredQuote2|block=1
|v1=text =
|v2=image =
|v3=speaker =
|v4=receiver =
|v5=attribution =
|v6=source =
|v7=clear =
}}

==Examples==
===Basic===
{{T|StructuredQuote2|_Y_=1|block=1
|p1=text = I never expected so many people would listen to my covers.
|p2=speaker = Utaite Name
}}

===With portrait and full attribution===
{{T|StructuredQuote2|_Y_=1|block=1
|p1=text = Thank you all for four wonderful years.
|p2=image = Template doc.png
|p3=speaker = Utaite Name
|p4=receiver = fans
|p5=attribution = during her 4th anniversary stream
|p6=source = 2024.01.25
}}

